  "notes": "Aggregated line rate 103.12 Gbps for 100GbE; per-lane rate 25.78 Gbps. Transmitter output power and receiver min/overload are average power per lane (footnote 3). Receiver min input and overload specified at BER 5x10-5 with PRBS 2^31-1 (footnote 4). Optical parameters yield BER 5x10-5; host FEC (IEEE802.3bj RS(528,514)) required for post-FEC BER better than 1x10-12. Power budget: 0–1.9 dB @ OM5, 1.8 dB @ OM4, 1.7 dB @ OM3; varies with fiber type. Typical reach: 75 m @ OM3, 100 m @ OM4, 150 m @ OM5. Transmission media stated as MM (2x LC). Storage temperature -40°C to +85°C (not operating). Transmitter max output printed as +2.0Bm.",
